graph TD
    A[Low-light Image] --> B[CIDNet Enhancement Model]
    B --> C[Enhanced Image]

    C --> D[AdaFace IR-50<br/>Frozen Face Recognizer]
    E[Ground Truth Image] --> D
    F[Impostor Image<br/>Different Person] --> D

    D --> G1[Multi-Level Features]
    G1 --> G2[layer2 w=0.2]
    G1 --> G3[layer3 w=0.4]
    G1 --> G4[layer4 w=0.8]
    G1 --> G5[fc w=1.0]

    G2 --> H1[Component 1:<br/>Reconstruction Loss]
    G3 --> H1
    G4 --> H1
    G5 --> H1

    H1 -.->|L_recon = Σ w_i × 1 - cos_sim| I[Total Face Loss]

    G5 --> H2[Component 2:<br/>Contrastive Loss]
    H2 -.->|L_contrast = -log exp_pos / exp_pos + exp_neg<br/>margin=0.4, temp=0.07| I

    G5 --> H3[Component 3:<br/>Triplet Margin Loss]
    H3 -.->|L_triplet = max0, d_ap - d_an + 0.2| I

    I --> J[Final Loss]
    K[L_RGB + L_HVI] --> J

    J -.->|FR_weight × Total Face Loss| L[Backprop to CIDNet]

    style A fill:#e1f5ff
    style C fill:#c8e6c9
    style D fill:#fff9c4
    style H1 fill:#ffccbc
    style H2 fill:#f8bbd0
    style H3 fill:#d1c4e9
    style I fill:#ffab91
    style J fill:#ef9a9a

    classDef lossComponent fill:#fff,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    class H1,H2,H3 lossComponent
